00:28:14.300 --> 00:28:16.280
I advised him to remove the others

00:28:16.280 --> 00:28:18.020
to give the little one a chance.

00:28:18.020 --> 00:28:19.040
And if that didn't work,

00:28:19.040 --> 00:28:27.620
then bottle feeding would be the only way.

00:28:27.620 --> 00:28:28.700
