00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.380
too for every one of hers.

00:33:01.850 --> 00:33:03.950
I'm sure she'll appreciate everything you've done

00:33:03.950 --> 00:33:04.670
when she's older.

00:33:05.410 --> 00:33:07.140
We can live in hope, can't we, Siegfried?

00:33:08.240 --> 00:33:10.440
Your father faring well?

00:33:11.430 --> 00:33:13.470
He never stops, much as I want him to.

00:33:17.630 --> 00:33:24.780
That's good. Keep hold of the neck, please.

00:33:25.270 --> 00:33:26.090
Good girl.

00:33:26.710 --> 00:33:29.250
Settle down. He's here to look after you.

00:33:29.250 --> 00:33:30.000
Oh, no.

00:33:31.210 --> 00:33:34.460
clean fracture of the metacarpal bone,

00:33:34.460 --> 00:33:37.090
but there's very little displacement.

00:33:37.090 --> 00:33:41.410
