00:35:10.880 --> 00:35:13.060
If you'd like to wait in here, I'll fetch a cut.

00:35:13.060 --> 00:35:16.580
Grab Leo for me while you're at it.

00:35:34.960 --> 00:35:44.950
Okay, you know, that's bad.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:03.160
Thank you.

00:36:03.160 --> 00:36:04.880
