00:36:04.880 --> 00:36:05.880
What's the operation?

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:16.920
Oh, simple castration, nothing major.

00:36:16.920 --> 00:36:19.630
What's that then?

00:36:19.630 --> 00:36:21.060
Jasper.

00:36:21.060 --> 00:36:22.370
Your cat?

00:36:22.370 --> 00:36:23.390
No, it isn't.

00:36:23.390 --> 00:36:25.040
Are you sure?

00:36:25.040 --> 00:36:27.140
You think I wouldn't know me own cat?

00:36:32.560 --> 00:36:35.930
- Sorry, Mrs. Hall, would you mind?

00:36:35.930 --> 00:36:36.770
- Jen?

00:36:36.770 --> 00:36:38.170
- It's the wrong cat.

00:36:38.170 --> 00:36:41.160
I don't understand, it said Jasper on the cage.

00:36:41.160 --> 00:36:42.760
I know it did, so how can it be?

00:36:42.760 --> 00:36:47.080
- Maybe because you came home soused last night.

00:36:47.080 --> 00:36:49.350
- I put them back in the wrong cages.

00:36:49.350 --> 00:36:50.800
Please don't say anything.

00:37:21.280 --> 00:37:26.180
call your letter today. Apologies for the delay, Mrs. Dinsdale. Now, the good news. Jasper's

00:37:26.180 --> 00:37:30.000
mange has cleared up and you can take him home today. The bad news, there'll be half a

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:32.360
That's not my cat neither.

