He's not dead.

00:38:01.800 --> 00:38:02.800
Merely chloroformed.

00:38:02.800 --> 00:38:05.290
Mrs Dinsdale, perhaps you could wait in the hole.

00:38:05.290 --> 00:38:07.950
You've drugged Apey.

00:38:07.950 --> 00:38:10.080
You've drugged my cat.

00:38:10.080 --> 00:38:12.730
For the love of God, will someone tell me what the hell is going on?

00:38:12.730 --> 00:38:13.730
It was my fault.

00:38:13.730 --> 00:38:15.730
More than likely, I should say.

00:38:15.730 --> 00:38:17.730
It was just a simple administrative error.

00:38:17.730 --> 00:38:19.730
