00:38:19.730 --> 00:38:22.230
Really, Harriet, how could you make such a fundamental mistake?

00:38:22.230 --> 00:38:24.730
Because he was bloody pie-eyed, I shouldn't imagine.

00:38:24.730 --> 00:38:26.810
Well, that's how my Henry tells it.

00:38:26.810 --> 00:38:28.140
What?

00:38:28.140 --> 00:38:29.900
You were drunk?

00:38:39.150 --> 00:38:41.490
Looks like it's you and me in the doghouse, Jess.

00:39:15.320 --> 00:39:17.340
What's wrong? I'm not going to have that.

00:39:17.340 --> 00:39:19.680
Because it's not one word and it's spelt differently.

00:39:19.680 --> 00:39:30.000
Yes, yes, apart from that.

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:34.860
only feeding the cats because he wanted to do a good job. It was a silly mistake.

00:39:35.410 --> 00:39:40.710
These people trust us with their animals. For the farmers it's their livelihood. I can't afford

