00:40:02.540 --> 00:40:03.830
- You never stop.

00:40:03.830 --> 00:40:05.050
You're always on the go.

00:40:05.050 --> 00:40:06.890
You'll run yourself into an early grave.

00:40:06.890 --> 00:40:08.030
