00:40:13.810 --> 00:40:18.840
He's a good boy taking his first steps in the working world.

00:40:18.840 --> 00:40:21.750
You must remember what that were like.

00:40:21.750 --> 00:40:25.820
How hard it was.

00:40:25.820 --> 00:40:28.450
