00:40:28.450 --> 00:40:29.540
You can't say I haven't tried.

00:40:29.540 --> 00:40:30.000
What is he the first?

00:40:30.030 --> 00:40:31.290
The fifth? The sixth?

00:40:31.290 --> 00:40:33.910
Well, you never gave any of them a fair crack at the whip.

00:40:33.910 --> 00:40:40.310
In fact, I might even go so far as to suggest you spiked his guns.

00:40:40.310 --> 00:40:42.070
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:40:42.070 --> 00:40:46.220
You led an horse to water knowing full well Sharpen Dinsdale would see you drank it.

00:40:46.220 --> 00:40:50.300
That's an absurd suggestion. I know you're the patron saint of lost causes, but really...

00:40:50.300 --> 00:40:52.860
And what exactly is that supposed to mean?

00:40:52.860 --> 00:40:56.560
That you care about people who... who sometimes don't deserve it.

00:40:56.560 --> 00:40:58.130
Oh, on that we must agree.

00:41:06.010 --> 00:41:12.580
He's a good lad. I don't doubt it. I'm afraid he still has to go.

00:41:53.130 --> 00:41:54.470
- I'm having trouble with calf.

00:41:54.470 --> 00:41:55.880
Can someone come and help us?

00:41:55.880 --> 00:41:58.200
