I can't bring it around to get it out.

00:44:55.710 --> 00:44:56.590
Jeez, I'm on a contraction.

00:45:03.480 --> 00:45:06.630
It's not good, it's not good, it's not coming around.

00:45:06.630 --> 00:45:13.130
Is that it then?

00:45:13.130 --> 00:45:15.680
Are they both done for?

00:45:15.680 --> 00:45:17.820
No.

00:45:17.820 --> 00:45:19.860
Now we keep trying.

00:46:00.600 --> 00:46:01.360
Good morning, good morning.

00:46:04.480 --> 00:46:04.980
Mrs. Hall.

00:46:13.180 --> 00:46:13.640
Too long.

00:46:14.700 --> 00:46:16.240
She found him.

00:46:18.670 --> 00:46:19.650
He wasn't making time.

00:46:21.250 --> 00:46:23.110
I don't want her to suffer.

00:46:23.960 --> 00:46:25.720
If it comes to it, you do what you gotta do.

